---
import H from "@/components/H.astro";
import Layout from "@/layouts/PageLayout.astro";
import Button from "@/components/Button.astro";
import Section from "@/components/Section.astro";
---

<Layout
    title="For Sponsors"
    description="Support Team V.A.N., a first-year 501(c)(3) FIRST Robotics team helping students in Brevard and Indian River counties gain hands-on STEM experience."
>
    <H>For Sponsors</H>

    <Section aria-labelledby="rookie-partner-heading">
        <H id="rookie-partner-heading" level="h2">
            Partner with a first-year team
        </H>
        <p>
            Team V.A.N. is a first-year FIRST Robotics Competition team still
            putting operations, outreach, and a robot in place. Because the
            program is being built as we go, we can work with you on a
            sponsorship that fits your organization, whether that means
            branding, a team showcase at an event, or another community
            initiative you already have in mind.
        </p>
        <p>
            Students handle design decisions, fundraising, and much of the
            outreach, so sponsor support goes toward the operating costs of a
            competition season: parts, tools, travel, registration, and the
            day-to-day work of running the team. Sponsors are featured on team
            shirts, the website, and the competition robot.
        </p>
        <p>
            <strong class="underline underline-offset-4">
                Anything helps.
            </strong>{" "}
            As a registered 501(c)(3) nonprofit, monetary contributions and
            qualifying in-kind donations to Team V.A.N. are tax-deductible.
        </p>
    </Section>

    <Section aria-labelledby="community-heading">
        <H id="community-heading" level="h2">
            Where we are
        </H>
        <p>
            We are based in Palm Bay, which makes Team V.A.N. the southernmost
            FRC team in Brevard County and the only FRC team serving northern
            Indian River County. Indian River County currently has no local FRC
            team. Our main build space is near Palm Bay Magnet, Bayside High,
            and Heritage High, and we are the closest FRC team to Sebastian
            River High, Vero Beach High, and Indian River Charter High.
        </p>
        <p>
            Palm Bay Magnet Senior High operates under a Title I schoolwide
            program, and Bayside High and Heritage High serve significant
            populations of economically disadvantaged students.
        </p>
    </Section>

    <Section aria-labelledby="how-we-operate-heading">
        <H id="how-we-operate-heading" level="h2">
            Where the team works
        </H>
        <p>
            Eastern Florida State College has pledged campus space and access to
            a machine shop, 3D printers, tools, and storage. Mind Forge Guild's
            makerspace is a second workspace for prototyping and weekend field
            practice. More about those partnerships is on the{" "}
            <a href="/about/" class="text-blue-300 underline underline-offset-4">
                About
            </a>{" "}
            page.
        </p>
    </Section>

    <Section aria-labelledby="ways-to-support-heading">
        <H id="ways-to-support-heading" level="h2">
            Ways you can support us
        </H>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li>
                <strong>Monetary sponsorships:</strong> Flexible tiers with logo
                placement on our competition robot, team apparel, pit displays,
                and digital media.
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>In-kind material and services:</strong> Raw aluminum,
                electrical hardware, fasteners, shop tools, 3D printing filament
                (PLA, PETG, TPU), or practice-field carpet.
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Community introductions:</strong> Connections to local
                businesses, civic groups, or others who may want to help.
            </li>
        </ul>
    </Section>

    <Section aria-labelledby="donations-heading">
        <H id="donations-heading" level="h2">
            Get in touch
        </H>
        <p>
            If you are interested in supporting the team, we would be glad to
            talk through what a partnership could look like.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 mt-4">
            <!--<Button
                target="_blank"
                href="/sponsor-packet.pdf"
                variant="secondary"
                disabled={true}
            >
                Download Sponsor Packet
            </Button>-->
            <Button
                href="mailto:contact@teamvan.org?subject=Sponsorship%20Inquiry%20-%20Team%20V.A.N."
                variant="secondary"
            >
                Contact Us For Sponsorship
            </Button>
        </div>
    </Section>
</Layout>
